Gaja through Sushena claim ten to eighty yojanas --- Jambavan recalls circling Vishnu and claims ninety yojanas --- Angada offers hundred yojanas but doubts return journey --- Jambavan forbids sending their leader as messenger --- Declares Angada the protected root of enterprise --- Angada warns of fasting to death if mission fails --- Jambavan turns to urge Hanuman as accomplisher